500<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Submission Deadline:<\/strong> Teams must submit their PPT\/Idea by <strong data-path-to-node=\"3,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">12-Oct-26<\/strong> to qualify (if your team does not qualify, the fee will be refunded to your original payment method).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div>Out-of-state teams travelling long distances are encouraged to submit their PPTs early.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">PPT Requirements:<\/strong> Must clearly mention the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">Problem Statement chosen<\/strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"69\">Solution Approach<\/strong>, <strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">Technology Stack<\/strong>, and <strong data-path-to-node=\"3,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"110\">Team Details<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Shortlist Announcement:<\/strong> Shortlisted teams\/PPTs will be declared by <strong data-path-to-node=\"3,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"67\">13-Oct-26<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Event Dates &amp; Venue:<\/strong><\/div>\n<br \/>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"3,6,1\">\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,6,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">24-hour Hackathon:<\/strong> 16th&ndash;17th October 2026 at BIT Campus, Bamni, Ballarpur.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,6,1,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ideathon Presentation:<\/strong> 17th October 2026 at BIT Campus, Bamni, Ballarpur.<br \/><br \/><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>Problem Statement<\/strong>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li><strong>Re-Identifying Individual Wild Animals.<\/strong>Identify individual animals, even when the viewing angle, lighting, distance, or image quality changes.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Tech for Wildlife Crime Prevention.<\/strong><br \/><span data-path-to-node=\"3,1,2,0\">Develop technology-driven solutions to detect, prevent, and combat wildlife crimes such as poaching, unlawful wildlife trade, cyber-based wildlife crime, and more.<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li><strong>Forest Fire Detection and Response.<\/strong><br \/>Build a system that detects potential forest fires early, identifies their location, and help communicate useful, actionable information for monitoring and response.<br \/><br \/>(<strong>Note<\/strong>: Participants are requested to bring all the necessary hardware\/components required to build and demonstrate their IoT solution.)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>Registration link (Google form).<br \/>Google Form link :<br \/><a href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/wnCwiB46e3ZHZNhS7\">https:\/\/forms.gle\/wnCwiB46e3ZHZNhS7<\/a><br \/><br \/><br \/><\/strong><\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mandatory Google Form Submission:<\/strong> Your registration will only be considered valid and complete after you fill out the official Google Form.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Payment via Google Form Only:<\/strong> All registration payments must be made directly inside the Google Form and <strong data-path-to-node=\"0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"105\">not<\/strong> through the Unstop platform.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Assistance:<\/strong> If your team requires any assistance, please feel free to reach out to the contact persons below.<br \/><br \/><\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Aniket Bahuriya:<\/strong> 8530007967<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sanjokta:<\/strong> 8788471834<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">S.S. Goje:<\/strong> 9834602964<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Piyush Gupta:<\/strong> 9607349454<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33500943,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-02T17:43:05+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T20:32:26+05:30","communication_sent":1,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"online_coding_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"NEaDwp7","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":0,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-02 17:52:54","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/uploadedManual-6abfb57987195_bit-logo.png","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploadedManual-6abfb57987195_bit-logo.png","regnRequirements":{"id":2496496,"opportunity_id":1764861,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":5,"min_team_size":2,"start_regn_dt":"2026-10-02T00:00:00+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-10T00:00:00+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_type":0,"same_organisation":